{"id":"654817","name":"凉拌猪肚","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/654817/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"猪肚","amount":"1个"}],"sub":[{"name":"香菜","amount":"一小把"},{"name":"沙姜","amount":"1块"},{"name":"葱头","amount":"1个"},{"name":"姜","amount":"几片"},{"name":"小米椒","amount":"1个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"猪肚处理干净。","img":"images/654817/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"凉水入锅，放入姜片和料酒焯水。","img":"images/654817/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"捞出，用温水清洗干净。","img":"images/654817/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"猪肚放入高压锅，加入水、盐、胡椒、料酒，煲20分钟。","img":"images/654817/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"时间到了，捞出放凉。","img":"images/654817/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"猪肚切成条状，装盘备用。","img":"images/654817/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"配料有香菜、葱头、沙姜、小米椒。","img":"images/654817/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"香菜切成段。","img":"images/654817/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"沙姜、葱头、小米椒切好放入碗内。","img":"images/654817/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"呛入热油。","img":"images/654817/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入酱油、陈醋、蚝油、糖、香油调拌均匀。","img":"images/654817/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"所有食材放一起拌匀。","img":"images/654817/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/654817/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：高压锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}